<title>ZAIRE: Mobutu leaves Zaire for foreign trip.</title>
<headline>Mobutu leaves Zaire for foreign trip.</headline>
<dateline>KINSHASA 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>President Mobutu Sese Seko flew out of Zaire on Wednesday to attend a regional summit meeting in Gabon.</p>
<p>A Reuter correspondent saw his plane depart for Libreville at 1015 local time (0915 GMT). Mobutu aides have said the president will return on Friday but there is much speculation in the capital Kinshasa that he would not return due to rebel advances.</p>
</text>
